      "content": "To explore pattern recognition without creating biased instruments, you could design hypothetical, neutral scenarios focusing on adaptability rather than specific group characteristics. For example, frame a situation where an individual must navigate rapid structural change or conflict resolution with ambiguous rules. Instead of asking about slang, ask participants how they process information when it is presented using highly informal or rapidly changing digital language. These templates allow you to study generalized responses to environmental pressures.",
